    {
      "platform": "windows",
      "version": "1.6.8",
      "release_date": "2026-10-21",
      "release_notes": "What's Changed\nThis update contains an important security fix. We strongly recommend you update as soon as possible!\n- Updated Electron to address the recent eMudhra certificate authority security issue which undermines trust in affected certificates. This does not mean Vesktop was compromised, but updating is strongly recommended.\n- Windows Screenshare: fixed stream containing other participants' voices\n- Fixed various issues related to screenshare with system audio on Linux\n- Improved the Native titlebar setting\n- Fixed not being able to zoom with Numpad +/-\n- Fixed various titlebar issues\n- AppImage: stop using dead fuse2\nFull Changelog: v1.6.7...v1.6.8",
